WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.320
The Move Inventory workflow allows you to manage and distribute your Amazon

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:10.280
warehousing and distribution or AWD inventory.

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:13.240
You have the option to choose

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:18.821
SKUs to be auto replenished to FBA when your FBA inventory gets low.

00:00:18.821 --> 00:00:19.680
When auto

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:24.480
replenishment isn't enough to meet expected sales, you can request additional

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:26.599
inventory be sent to FBA.

00:00:26.599 --> 00:00:31.260
You can also send your AWD inventory in bulk to your

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:37.200
own warehouse, third-party warehouses, wholesalers, and distributors with AWD's

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:39.644
multi-channel distribution capability.

00:00:39.644 --> 00:00:43.920
To initiate a move, select Move Inventory

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:45.977
on the AWD program page.

00:00:45.977 --> 00:00:49.680
If you are moving within the Amazon network, select

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:51.905
FBA replenishment under Distribution Type.

00:00:51.905 --> 00:00:55.020
If you are moving to off Amazon

00:00:55.020 --> 00:01:01.160
locations on the Move From Storage page, select Off Amazon Distribution under

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:02.052
Distribution Type.

00:01:02.052 --> 00:01:06.960
Then select the origin warehouse from the move from drop-down

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:10.347
and the destination from the destination drop-down.

00:01:10.347 --> 00:01:12.040
To add channels and

00:01:12.040 --> 00:01:16.680
destinations, click Manage Destinations when selecting the Off Amazon

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:20.063
Distribution option in the Move Inventory workflow.

00:01:20.063 --> 00:01:22.480
Then enter the channel and

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:24.665
destination information, then click Save.

00:01:24.665 --> 00:01:28.160
Next, select the SKUs you want to move

00:01:28.160 --> 00:01:31.424
by entering the number of boxes to move.

00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:34.280
Click Confirm to confirm the move and

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:36.357
then click Review Move Request.

00:01:36.357 --> 00:01:39.680
On the Review Move Request page, confirm the

00:01:39.680 --> 00:01:42.760
move request by clicking Confirm Move Request.

00:01:42.760 --> 00:01:44.960
Once you see the confirmation

00:01:44.960 --> 00:01:49.880
page, your move request has been completed.
